        No single pouch is best for everyone, so this guide is split by use case. Our current all-round pick is ZYN Cool Mint, while VELO leads for assortment breadth, LOOP stays strong on value, and White Fox / Siberia remain specialist options for experienced users.
      </p>
    </div>

    <details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">What is the #1 nicotine pouch in 2026?</summary>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">For this ranking, ZYN Cool Mint is the safest all-round recommendation, not a universal winner for every user. We separate “best overall” from “best value”, “best beginner pick”, and “best strong pick” because the right choice depends on your flavour preferences and nicotine tolerance.</p>
    </details>

    <details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">Are nicotine pouches FDA approved?</summary>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">Nicotine pouches are not FDA pre-approved as a category, but individual products may be marketed under the FDA's existing nicotine product regulations. Most major brands like ZYN and VELO operate within regulatory frameworks in their respective markets, though approval status varies by country.</p>
    </details>

    <details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">Which nicotine pouch has the best flavour?</summary>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">Flavour preference is subjective, but <a href="/brands/zyn" style="color: hsl(var(--primary));">ZYN's Wintergreen, Peppermint, and Cinnamon</a> are consistently rated highest for intensity and authenticity. <a href="/brands/velo" style="color: hsl(var(--primary));">VELO's Spearmint</a> and Nordic Winter also rank among top-rated options for their fresh, balanced profiles.</p>
    </details>

    <p>The nicotine pouch market has exploded. <strong>In 2023, Europe alone hit EUR 1.6 billion — and the category is growing at 28.8% annually</strong> (source: <a href="https://www.grandviewresearch.com/industry-analysis/nicotine-pouches-market-report">Grand View Research</a>). With more than 50 brands now competing for shelf space, choosing the right pouch has become harder, not easier.</p>

    <p>Based on our testing of over {facts.productCountLabel} products across {facts.brandCountLabel} brands, we identified clear winners in seven categories — from best overall to best value.</p>

    <p>We've tested hundreds of pouches across strength, flavour, pouch comfort, and value. This guide cuts through the noise and identifies the category winners you can actually trust. Whether you're after a reliable daily driver, a gentler entry point, or high strength, we've got you covered.</p>

    <div class="not-prose grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-8">
